Sire’s Hollow Bookstore

[en.FOCUS_C09_SH_BOOKSTORE_desc]
“You’ll have to experience the books from outside. That’s why windows are see through.”\n— Relax, we now offer e-books and have added benches outside.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SH_BOOKSTORE]
名流谷书店

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SH_BOOKSTORE_desc]
“你们只能站在外面看书。这就是为什么窗户是透明的。”\n——放心吧，我们现在提供电子版了，并且在店外面加了小板凳。

